WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.570
<v Narrator>So, let's go ahead and create an AWS account.</v>

2
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.610
For this on the website of AWS,

3
00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.950
I'm going to click on Create account.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.470
So, if you see a signup page like this,

5
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.370
this is not what we want.

6
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.060
We want to click on the bottom right to Sign up advanced.

7
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.920
And then you are redirected to this URL,

8
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.380
which is exactly what we want.

9
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
Here, I'm taken to the portal signup

10
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.060
and I need to put an email address

11
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.530
called the root user email address.

12
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.563
So this is your email address, as well as an account name.

13
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.460
So next, after you verify your email address,

14
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.720
put a password.

15
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.010
So the password has constraints.

16
00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.510
It must be eight characters long

17
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.210
and must have at least three of the following uppercase,

18
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.330
lowercase numbers, and non-alpha numeric characters.

19
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.220
And please, please, please, please, please

20
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.870
do not lose your passport.

21
00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.970
Put it somewhere safe.

22
00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.070
And next, we have an account plan.

23
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.770
So here we can choose between free or paid.

24
00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:57.690
So in both cases, you are going to be spending money in AWS

25
00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.180
and you are going to start with about $100 in credit

26
00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.850
and you can receive up to 200 in total.

27
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.700
The difference between free and paid account plan

28
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.910
is that in the free plan you don't put a credit card down.

29
00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.440
And if you run out of credits,

30
00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.230
then your account will be closed automatically.

31
00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.900
In the paid account, this is where you want

32
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.830
to have production-ready workloads.

33
00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.780
And so you're going to put your credit card down

34
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.940
and in case you go over your credits,

35
00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.710
then you're going to, of course,

36
00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:24.450
be charged on your credit card.

37
00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.450
So, for us to learn AWS safely,

38
00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.160
we're going to use a free account

39
00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.540
and this will be enough for this course.

40
00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.593
In case you need to do some things that are paid,

41
00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.450
AWS is going to prompt you to add in your credit card

42
00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.660
and you will be free to do so, if you choose to.

43
00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:42.480
But these amount of credits should be enough for us,

44
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:45.900
more than enough for us, to learn AWS together safely.

45
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.900
So, let's go ahead and Choose free plan.

46
00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:53.280
And then we put in our contact information for AWS.

47
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.340
So, this is a personal project.

48
00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.930
Here's my full name,

49
00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.300
and then I'll just enter more information.

50
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.880
So here, you have to enter your credit card number.

51
00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.970
So this is necessary even if you have a free plan.

52
00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.800
The reason why they want you to have a credit card

53
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.830
is that they want to verify your account and prevent fraud.

54
00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.240
So, if you have a free plan,

55
00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.100
even if you put a credit card number down,

56
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.450
you're going to have no charges

57
00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:18.330
until you actually upgrade to a paid plan.

58
00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:22.380
So, this is a safe way to put your credit card info,

59
00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.300
but don't worry, you're not going to be charged.

60
00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:28.290
Just $1 is going to be used for the verification process.

61
00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.490
And of course, that money is going

62
00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.280
to be refunded to you right away.

63
00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.470
Next, we must confirm our identity

64
00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.003
by providing a phone number,

65
00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.750
and then you may be prompted for a support plan.

66
00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.660
And here I just choose basic support, which is free,

67
00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.417
and then complete the signup.

68
00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.850
Now, your account is being activated

69
00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:51.120
and we should receive an email when this is complete.

70
00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.180
And finally, I am logged in the UI.

71
00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.920
If somehow you don't see this page

72
00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:59.670
and you just need to log in the UI again, just sign out.

73
00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.880
And when you send out, click on Sign in to console.

74
00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.270
And by clicking on it, you can go to here, this page.

75
00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.860
And here you're going to click on

76
00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:10.320
Signing using root user email.

77
00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:11.640
And actually, we have an improved sign in,

78
00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.620
so this is the one.

79
00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.080
So root user, then you enter your email address

80
00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.300
that you used during signup.

81
00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.000
And you may be prompted with this upon sign in.

82
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.840
Do not worry, we're going to

83
00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.160
take care of this during the course.

84
00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.573
So just skip for now.

85
00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:29.040
And you are back in the AWS console and you're good to go.

86
00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.530
That's it. You've created an account. Congratulations.

87
00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.683
